output: <s> What do hamburgers and dumplings have in common? 12 December 2020 by Janet H. (verified owner) It seems that you are unable to use these recipes at this time due to an unfortunate glitch on our website. The dough will be sticky, so you may need to add more flour depending on how much liquid you have added. They are both comfort foods that have been passed down through generations. They are both made from simple ingredients that are easy to find.</s>

